  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おなかに　ためた　エネルギーがくちばしから　もれないようにくびを　ねもとで　むすんでいるらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "배에 비축해 둔 에너지가 부리를 통해 새어 나오지 않게 하기 위해 목 아래쪽을 꼬아 놓은 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "為了避免積蓄在肚子裡的能量外流，似乎會把自己的脖子繫在頸根部上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On pense qu’il fait un nœud à la base de son cou afin d’empêcher l’énergie qu’il accumule dans son ventre de s’échapper par son bec.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon verknotet offenbar seinen Hals am Ansatz, damit die im Bauch gespeicherte Energie nicht über den Schnabel entweicht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al parecer, se anudan la base del cuello para impedir que la energía que tienen almacenada en el estómago escape por el pico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sembra che il nodo che fa alla base del collo serva a evitare che l’energia accumulata nel suo stomaco fuoriesca dal becco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon apparently ties the base of its neck into a knot so that energy stored in its belly does not escape from its beak.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "お腹に　溜めた　エネルギーがくちばしから　漏れないように首を　根元で　結んでいるらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "为了避免积蓄在肚子里的能量流出，它似乎会把自己的脖子系在颈根部上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al parecer, se anudan la base del cuello para impedir que la energía que tienen almacenada en el estómago escape por el pico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "シンクロとよばれる　しゅうせいによりむれの　ぜんいんが　いっしみだれずいっせいに　こうげきしてくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "싱크로라 불리는 습성으로 인해 무리 전체가 일사불란하게 움직여 일제히 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有被稱為同步的習性，因此攻擊時整個群體會有條不紊地一起衝過來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Leur capacité à se synchroniser permet à toute une volée d’attaquer parfaitement à l’unisson.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dank ihres synchronisierten Verhaltens können alle Mitglieder eines Schwarms perfekt aufeinander abgestimmte Angriffe ausführen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon presenta una conducta sincrónica que permite a la colonia entera atacar simultáneamente como una única entidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha l’abitudine di agire all’unisono con i membri del suo gruppo per lanciare un attacco perfettamente sincronizzato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Thanks to a behavior of theirs known as “synchronizing,” an entire flock of these Pokémon can attack simultaneously in perfect harmony.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "シンクロと呼ばれる　習性により群れの　全員が　一糸乱れず一斉に　攻撃してくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有被称为同步的习性，因此会整个群体一起有条不紊地发动攻击。",
      "language": {
